#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:1
msgid "Manage business invoices"
msgstr "Gestionar las facturas de tu negocio"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:3
msgid ""
"Record the invoices your business issues and receives: the money a "
"customer owes you and the money you owe a supplier. This guide covers "
"both kinds and shows which records feed your tax calculations."
msgstr ""
"Registra las facturas que emite y recibe tu negocio: el dinero que te "
"debe un clientete y el dinero que debes a un proveedor. Esta guía cubre "
"ambos tipos y muestra qué registros alimentan tus cálculos fiscales."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:7
msgid ""
"A business invoice is not the same as a purchase receipt you attach as a "
"supporting document. Receipts support a deductible expense on a "
"transaction in your records (see [Attach invoices and receipts to "
"transactions](ledger-evidence.md)). Business invoices recorded here are "
"the commercial documents themselves: an *issued* invoice (you billed a "
"customer) or a *received* invoice (a supplier billed you)."
msgstr ""
"Una factura de negocio no es lo mismo que un recibo de compra que "
"adjuntas como justificante. Los recibos respaldan un gasto deducible en "
"un movimiento de tus registros (consulta [Adjuntar facturas y recibos a "
"los movimientos](ledger-evidence.md)). Las facturas de negocio que se "
"registran aquí son los documentos comerciales en sí: una factura "
"*emitida* (facturaste a un cliente) o una factura *recibida* (un "
"proveedor te facturó)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:13
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Antes de empezar"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:15
msgid "You need:"
msgstr "Necesitas:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:17
msgid ""
"An active taxpayer profile. Every command on this page works on the "
"active profile; if none is set, the command refuses. See [Set up your "
"taxpayer profile](profile-setup.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil de contribuyente activo. Todos los comandos de esta página "
"operan sobre el perfil activo; si no hay ninguno establecido, el comando "
"se niega a continuar. Consulta [Configurar tu perfil de contribuyente"
"](profile-setup.md)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:20
msgid ""
"Your passphrase. The tool prompts for it the first time it opens your "
"encrypted storage in a session."
msgstr ""
"Tu frase de contraseña. La herramienta te la pide la primera vez que abre"
" tu almacenamiento cifrado en una sesión."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:23
msgid ""
"The examples in this documentation are recorded in English. `aeat` prints"
" its messages in Spanish unless you [choose another language](profile-"
"setup.md#choose-the-output-language)."
msgstr ""
"Los ejemplos de esta documentación están grabados en inglés. `aeat` "
"muestra sus mensajes en español, salvo que [elijas otro idioma](profile-"
"setup.md#choose-the-output-language)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:27
msgid "One invoice catalogue"
msgstr "Un único catálogo de facturas"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:29
msgid ""
"Cadrumo keeps business invoices in one catalogue (`aeat app ledger "
"invoice ...`): a record of who owes you and whom you owe. Use it to "
"record, list, and edit invoices."
msgstr ""
"Cadrumo guarda las facturas de negocio en un único catálogo (`aeat app "
"ledger invoice ...`): un registro de quién te debe y a quién debes. Úsalo"
" para registrar, listar y editar facturas."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:33
msgid ""
"Every invoice you record is linkable and calculable. Match it to a bank "
"transaction with `aeat app ledger link`, and a calculation reads it "
"directly, for example the Modelo 349 recapitulative declaration of intra-"
"community operations."
msgstr ""
"Cada factura que registras es enlazable y calculable. Vincúlala a un "
"movimiento bancario con `aeat app ledger link`, y un cálculo la lee "
"directamente, por ejemplo el Modelo 349, declaración recapitulativa de "
"operaciones intracomunitarias."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:37
msgid ""
"Record every invoice with `invoice add`. There is no second copy to "
"create."
msgstr ""
"Registra cada factura con `invoice add`. No hay que crear una segunda "
"copia."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:39
msgid ""
"`invoice add` requires `--kind issued` or `--kind received`, and `invoice"
" list` accepts it as a filter. *Issued* means a customer owes you; "
"*received* means you owe a supplier. `invoice view`, `update`, and "
"`remove` take only the invoice id. `invoice add` also requires "
"`--country-code`, the counterparty's two-letter country code."
msgstr ""
"`invoice add` requiere `--kind issued` o `--kind received`, y `invoice "
"list` lo acepta como filtro. *Emitida* significa que un cliente te debe; "
"*recibida* significa que debes a un proveedor. `invoice view`, `update` y"
" `remove` solo aceptan el id de la factura. `invoice add` también "
"requiere `--country-code`, el código de país de dos letras de la "
"contraparte."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:45
msgid "Record an issued invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura emitida"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:47
msgid ""
"Record an invoice you sent to a customer. The command returns the new "
"`invoice_id`, the computed totals, and the values you entered:"
msgstr ""
"Registra una factura que enviaste a un cliente. El comando devuelve el "
"nuevo `invoice_id`, los totales calculados y los valores que "
"introdujiste:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:54
msgid ""
"Record the `invoice_id`; you address the invoice by it (or by an "
"unambiguous prefix)."
msgstr ""
"Anota el `invoice_id`: con él (o con un prefijo inequívoco) te refieres a"
" la factura."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:57
msgid "Record a received invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura recibida"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:59
msgid "Record an invoice a supplier sent you. Its `kind` reads `received`:"
msgstr "Registra una factura que te envió un proveedor. Su `kind` es `received`:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:65
msgid "List, view, update, and remove"
msgstr "Lista, consulta, actualiza y elimina"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:67
msgid ""
"List both kinds or filter to one, add a note to a stored invoice, then "
"remove it. The view of one invoice takes its id (or an unambiguous "
"prefix):"
msgstr ""
"Lista los dos tipos o filtra por uno, añade una nota a una factura "
"guardada y elimínala después. La consulta de una factura toma su id (o un"
" prefijo inequívoco):"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:74
msgid "Record an intra-community invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura intracomunitaria"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:76
msgid ""
"A supply to, or acquisition from, a VAT-registered business in another EU"
" country is an intra-community operation. Record it on the issued or "
"received invoice with the counterparty's country and EU VAT id, plus the "
"Modelo 349 operation type:"
msgstr ""
"Una entrega a, o una adquisición de, una empresa registrada a efectos de "
"IVA en otro país de la UE es una operación intracomunitaria. Regístrala "
"en la factura emitida o recibida con el país y el número de IVA europeo "
"de la contraparte, más el tipo de operación del Modelo 349:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:85
msgid ""
"`--operation-type` takes one M349 operation key: `E` supplies of goods, "
"`M` supplies after an exempt import, `H` the same via a fiscal "
"representative, `A` acquisitions of goods, `T` triangular supplies, `S` "
"services supplied, `I` services acquired, and the call-off-stock keys `R`"
" (transfers), `D` (returns), and `C` (substitutions)."
msgstr ""
"`--operation-type` toma una clave de operación del M349: `E` entregas de "
"bienes, `M` entregas tras una importación exenta, `H` lo mismo mediante "
"representante fiscal, `A` adquisiciones de bienes, `T` entregas "
"triangulares, `S` servicios prestados, `I` servicios adquiridos, y las "
"claves de ventas en consigna `R` (transferencias), `D` (devoluciones) y "
"`C` (sustituciones)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:91
msgid ""
"`invoice update` corrects the note, counterparty name and country, "
"operation type and date, VAT category, withholding, invoice class, "
"series, and the rectified invoice number. To correct the invoice number, "
"date, tax id, currency, or totals, remove the invoice and record it "
"again."
msgstr ""
"`invoice update` corrige la nota, el nombre y el país de la contraparte, "
"el tipo y la fecha de la operación, la categoría de IVA, la retención, la"
" clase de factura, la serie y el número de la factura rectificada. Para "
"corregir el número de factura, la fecha, el identificador fiscal, la "
"moneda o los totales, elimina la factura y vuelve a registrarla."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:96
msgid "Feed a calculation from the catalogue"
msgstr "Alimenta un cálculo desde el catálogo"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:98
msgid ""
"Every invoice in the catalogue reaches a modelo calculation and can be "
"linked to a bank transaction. The sequence records an intra-community "
"supply, lists and inspects the catalogue, then creates and calculates the"
" Modelo 349 recapitulative declaration for the period the invoice falls "
"in:"
msgstr ""
"Todas las facturas del catálogo llegan al cálculo de un modelo y se "
"pueden vincular a un movimiento bancario. La secuencia registra una "
"entrega intracomunitaria, lista e inspecciona el catálogo, y luego crea y"
" calcula la declaración recapitulativa del Modelo 349 para el periodo en "
"el que cae la factura:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:107
msgid ""
"For an intra-community operation, pass `--operation-type` so the invoice "
"carries the classification the Modelo 349 calculation reads. Use `E`, "
"`H`, `M`, `S`, `T`, `R`, `D`, or `C` for issued catalogue invoices. Use "
"`A`, `I`, or `T` for received catalogue invoices. In Modelo 349, `R` is "
"the call-off-stock transfer key; rectification rows use separate "
"rectified-period and base fields."
msgstr ""
"Para una operación intracomunitaria, pasa `--operation-type` para que la "
"factura lleve la clasificación que lee el cálculo del Modelo 349. Usa "
"`E`, `H`, `M`, `S`, `T`, `R`, `D` o `C` para las facturas emitidas del "
"catálogo. Usa `A`, `I` o `T` para las facturas recibidas del catálogo. En"
" el Modelo 349, `R` es la clave de transferencia de ventas en consigna; "
"las filas de rectificación usan campos separados de periodo rectificado y"
" base."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:113
msgid ""
"An invoice is counted in the period of the date you record with "
"`--operation-date`, so record the devengo date that LIVA art. 75 sets. "
"For an intra-community supply of goods, that is the 15th of the month "
"after the transport starts, or the invoice date if it is earlier (art. "
"75.Uno.8.º). Without `--operation-date`, the invoice date stands in for "
"it. Modelo 349 reads invoices strictly by that date, with no carry-"
"forward from earlier periods."
msgstr ""
"Una factura se cuenta en el periodo de la fecha que registres con "
"`--operation-date`, así que registra la fecha de devengo que fija el art."
" 75 de la LIVA. En una entrega intracomunitaria de bienes, es el día 15 "
"del mes siguiente al inicio del transporte, o la fecha de la factura si "
"es anterior (art. 75.Uno.8.º). Sin `--operation-date`, la fecha de la "
"factura hace sus veces. El Modelo 349 lee las facturas estrictamente por "
"esa fecha, sin arrastre de periodos anteriores."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:121
msgid "Link a catalogue invoice to a transaction"
msgstr "Vincula una factura del catálogo a un movimiento"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:123
msgid ""
"Link a catalogue invoice to the bank transaction that paid or collected "
"it. The example starts with one bank transaction and one issued invoice, "
"links them, and confirms the link on the invoice:"
msgstr ""
"Vincula una factura del catálogo al movimiento bancario que la pagó o la "
"cobró. El ejemplo parte de un movimiento bancario y una factura emitida, "
"los vincula y confirma el vínculo en la factura:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:131
msgid ""
"Remove a catalogue invoice you created by mistake, confirming with "
"`--yes`. If the invoice is still linked to a transaction, the removal is "
"refused, so the bank transaction never ends up citing an invoice that no "
"longer exists. `aeat` has no command that unlinks an invoice. Removing "
"the linked transaction releases the link (see [Correct mistakes in your "
"records](correct-ledger-entries.md)). The example removes an invoice that"
" has no link:"
msgstr ""
"Elimina una factura del catálogo que creaste por error, confirmando con "
"`--yes`. Si la factura sigue vinculada a un movimiento, la eliminación se"
" rechaza, para que el movimiento bancario nunca acabe citando una factura"
" que ya no existe. `aeat` no tiene ningún comando que desvincule una "
"factura. Eliminar el movimiento vinculado libera el vínculo (consulta "
"[Corregir errores en tus registros](correct-ledger-entries.md)). El "
"ejemplo elimina una factura que no tiene vínculo:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:142
msgid "Which modelos read your invoices"
msgstr "Qué modelos leen tus facturas"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:144
msgid ""
"Catalogue invoices feed **Modelo 349** (the recapitulative declaration of"
" intra-community operations) through the operation type you stamp on them"
" when you create them. This is the modelo your issued and received "
"invoices drive directly. Modelo 100 calculations also read the invoice "
"linked to an income or expense transaction, for example the withholding "
"declared on it."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas del catálogo alimentan el **Modelo 349** (la declaración "
"recapitulativa de operaciones intracomunitarias) mediante el tipo de "
"operación que les asignas al crearlas. Este es el modelo que tus facturas"
" emitidas y recibidas alimentan directamente. Los cálculos del Modelo 100"
" también leen la factura vinculada a un movimiento de ingreso o de gasto,"
" por ejemplo la retención declarada en ella."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:150
msgid ""
"Modelo 303 (quarterly VAT) and Modelo 390 (annual VAT summary) take their"
" amounts from the transactions you have classified in your records, not "
"from the invoice catalogue. They do check the catalogue: if an invoice's "
"VAT for the period exceeds what your records carry, the calculation "
"refuses until you record and classify the matching transactions (see "
"[Classify transactions](classify-transactions.md)). Recording an invoice "
"here does not add it to a Modelo 303."
msgstr ""
"El Modelo 303 (IVA trimestral) y el Modelo 390 (resumen anual de IVA) "
"toman sus importes de los movimientos que has clasificado en tus "
"registros, no del catálogo de facturas. Sí consultan el catálogo: si el "
"IVA de una factura para el periodo supera lo que recogen tus registros, "
"el cálculo se niega a continuar hasta que registres y clasifiques los "
"movimientos correspondientes (consulta [Clasificar movimientos](classify-"
"transactions.md)). Registrar una factura aquí no la añade a un Modelo "
"303."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:157
msgid ""
"Cross-border B2C sales under the One-Stop-Shop scheme (Modelo 369) are a "
"separate flow not yet reachable from `invoice add`; record those through "
"the OSS-specific workflow."
msgstr ""
"Las ventas transfronterizas B2C acogidas al régimen de ventanilla única "
"(Modelo 369) siguen un flujo aparte, todavía no accesible desde `invoice "
"add`; regístralas mediante el flujo específico de OSS."

